  "method": "Independent covariance implementation on alpha>24 pixels. Removes only x>135,y<90 upper-head extrema; no body or tail movement occurs. Axis is undirected modulo180 degrees. Near-unity eigenvalue ratios make orientation sensitive to small changes in silhouette.",
